  "details": "Imposters feel like a sort of black box. They are system generated and you can't really preview them, either on the website or in the client. (If there is a way to, sorry I haven't found it, maybe it's too difficult to find?) \n\nMy experience has been \"hey your avatar looks really bad\" \"oh crap, send me a screenshot\". So another user is involved and a print camera comes out.\n\nI propose generating a front and 45° static view or something, and show those in the client and website, alongside the regular avatar. In the client, maybe show the imposter mesh as a left/right button under the current avatar turntable which gives you the animated preview. \n\nJust make it easier to see what your imposters look like.",
